# The inbox: catch things at the top, decide about them below (one note at a time).
title: Inbox
rows:
  - [capture]
  - [{view: review, filters: 'type == "fleeting"', types: [literature, atomic, project]}]
  - columns:
      - [{view: list, from: "folder:", filters: 'type == "fleeting"', title: Still fleeting}]
      - [{view: review, title: Asked to come back}]
